1
00:00:45,168 --> 00:00:49,480
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,505 --> 00:00:51,377
=Episode 21=

3
00:00:52,833 --> 00:00:55,340
(Lanruo Hall)

4
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,799
Fengniang?

5
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,239
One is already more than enough.

6
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:13,959
Why bring another one back?

7
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:16,120
Lanruo Hall isn't a shelter.

8
00:01:16,477 --> 00:01:18,120
We don't take in just anyone.

9
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,159
Lanxi,

10
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:23,959
have you ever heard of

11
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:25,599
Heavenly Justice,

12
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,000
Underworld Soul,

13
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,000
and Tearless Tear?

14
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:31,000
Why do you ask about these?

15
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,040
I am going to kill Yu Linjun.

16
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,879
You're going to slay his Lord?

17
00:01:36,947 --> 00:01:37,748
Shh.

18
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,200
Ziyan,

19
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,799
I don't care
where you heard such nonsense,

20
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,120
But Yu Linjun

21
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:52,400
is not someone you or I can fight.

22
00:01:52,519 --> 00:01:53,640
If you fail...

23
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,280
I'm just his next meal,

24
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:56,680
a caged demon.

25
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:57,879
Even if I don't kill him,

26
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,560
he will kill me eventually.

27
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:09,080
I don't know
Heavenly Justice and Tearless Tear.

28
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,599
But the Underworld Soul...

29
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:13,159
it's the heart-soul of someone
brought back from death.

30
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,680
Right now, I'm the only one who has it.

31
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,319
I can give it to you.

32
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:21,960
Lanxi,

33
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:24,879
you're not going to stop me?

34
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:30,039
I've already died once.

35
00:02:30,639 --> 00:02:31,840
When my own sister

36
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,319
is in need,

37
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:37,360
how could I stand by and do nothing?

38
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,080
And let an outsider interfere?

39
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,240
Let's split up.

40
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,199
We'll track down
the other two ingredients.

41
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:56,560
Young Taoist, stay alive.

42
00:02:58,319 --> 00:02:59,000
Ziyan.

43
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,800
Hmm.

44
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:02,240
This little servant of yours
is interesting.

45
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:04,879
Bring him to my room tonight.

46
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:09,120
He is rather handsome.

47
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,039
With some training...

48
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,479
Lanxi.

49
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:13,000
Hmm.

50
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,759
Isn't my company enough for you?

51
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,840
He is merely a servant.

52
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,599
He is unworthy of you.

53
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,280
There are better ones

54
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:21,719
for you to choose from.

55
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,840
It is fine, Yuanchu.

56
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,280
She's just lost her memory.

57
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,319
We'll gather what we need first,

58
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,159
then kill Yu Linjun and mend the sky.

59
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,080
Heavenly Justice

60
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,479
needs a pure body as its vessel.

61
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,240
Once you begin,

62
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,759
your heart and mind
must be free of all distraction.

63
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,840
As for Tearless Tear...

64
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,879
- Shangguan Piaopiao.
- Shangguan Piaopiao.

65
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:49,759
Who dares call me by my name?

66
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,560
Hahaha.

67
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,080
Godmother.

68
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,520
Mother didn't come all this way

69
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:04,800
just because you missed me, did you?

70
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:10,719
My dear daughter.

71
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,039
I heard our Lord
has taken a liking to you,

72
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,400
making you Demon Queen.

73
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:17,680
I couldn't be happier for you.

74
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,040
(It seems Yu Linjun)

75
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,800
(means to use)

76
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,600
(the bond between mother and daughter)

77
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,040
(to make my Love Flower bloom.)

78
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:25,759
(Fine.)

79
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,600
(I'll use this chance)

80
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:29,000
(to get the Tearless Tear.)

81
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:33,720
You little demon brat.

82
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:37,959
Are you scheming to steal my position

83
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:40,120
as Madam of Lanruo Hall?

84
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,680
You'd better make it worth my while.

85
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:45,120
What are you saying?

86
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:47,720
Isn't my money yours?

87
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,680
If one day,

88
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:53,160
I find someone I love,

89
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:56,519
what dowry will you give me

90
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:57,639
for my wedding, mother?

91
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,000
Oh, seriously,

92
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:03,560
you have learned to bargain with me.

93
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:07,160
You really have grown up.

94
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,319
Tell me, what do you want?

95
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:13,959
It's simple.

96
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:17,079
One tear from you.

97
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,199
Insolent!

98
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:24,680
I am a Lishuo Rabbit Demon.

99
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,480
I was born without tears.

100
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:30,040
You little brat.

101
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,439
You've gotten too bold.

102
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:33,519
More disrespectful by the day!

103
00:05:43,198 --> 00:05:45,628
(Godmother used the Spirit-Calling Art)

104
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,999
(to enter my illusion.)

105
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:50,240
(Why did that young Taoist appear)

106
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,613
(in my Demon Essence Memory?)

107
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,279
(You little demon brat,)

108
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:57,560
(Demon Essence Memories never lie.)

109
00:05:58,879 --> 00:05:59,959
(Think carefully.)

110
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:03,879
(Would you really
bloom with love for Yu Linjun?)

111
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,319
How did you get into my illusion?

112
00:06:14,519 --> 00:06:15,759
If Godmother finds out,

113
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:16,879
you're dead.

114
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,000
Get out now.

115
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,720
(Just now in the illusion,)

116
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,040
(my Love Flower bloomed.)

117
00:06:34,759 --> 00:06:38,040
(Could this young Taoist really be...)

118
00:06:47,879 --> 00:06:49,319
No man has ever walked out

119
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:51,160
of Godmother's illusion alive.

120
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:52,920
My sister must be protecting you.

121
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,000
You little servant,

122
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,720
how did you bewitch my sister?

123
00:06:56,959 --> 00:06:58,439
Excuse me, miss.

124
00:06:58,439 --> 00:06:59,279
Hey!

125
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,040
That's not quite right.

126
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,720
They are proper husband and wife.

127
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:05,680
Husband and wife?

128
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,519
I have never heard Ziyan mention this.

129
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,959
They love each other,

130
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:12,839
married in heart.

131
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,199
We outsiders cannot compare.

132
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:17,680
If she hadn't lost her memory,

133
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,720
she'd never marry that freak Yu Linjun.

134
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:26,040
(Such strange demon energy.)

135
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:30,439
(Could she really come back from death?)

136
00:07:31,879 --> 00:07:33,000
Words are cheap.

137
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,759
Don't try to fool me.

138
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,920
True

139
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,800
or false,

140
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,079
only time will tell.

141
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,279
Gaining Tearless Tear

142
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,879
won't be easy.

143
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:57,639
Let's help you
gather Heavenly Justice first.

144
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:02,439
It needs a pure body as its vessel.

145
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:05,439
Before, Yuanchu could refine it
in moments.

146
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,079
But now he's lost all his power,

147
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,759
corrupted by foul energy.

148
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:13,079
He may not be able to hold it.

149
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,160
Unless we find a place
thick with foul energy.

150
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,519
Use foulness to cleanse foulness.

151
00:08:17,639 --> 00:08:18,519
When it peaks, it reverses.

152
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,399
Then it can be condensed.

153
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,079
The Void Realm.

154
00:08:24,759 --> 00:08:26,920
The Uncrossable Ferry
before Yu Linjun's Ninghua Palace.

155
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:51,320
To reach Ninghua Palace,
one must cross the Uncrossable Ferry.

156
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,120
If your demon power isn't strong enough,

157
00:08:53,144 --> 00:08:55,663
you'll die, your soul
sinking into the depths forever.

158
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,840
You're just a mortal.

159
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:59,320
You will surely die.

160
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:01,200
Don't be afraid, Yuanchu.

161
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,519
I'm here.

162
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,960
If you sink to the bottom,

163
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,919
I'll drink every last drop of that water

164
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,080
to pull you out.

165
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:21,799
What is this?

166
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,960
It's made from the Essence
of hundreds of demons.

167
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,759
If you cannot cross the lake,

168
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:27,039
crush this,

169
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:28,440
it'll get you out safely.

170
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,120
Don't misunderstand.

171
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,240
I just don't want you to die

172
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:36,159
and lose my cure.

173
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,879
You have only one chance.

174
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:42,240
Cross the Ferry,
and you'll obtain Heavenly Justice.

175
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,080
I will cross it.

176
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,960
Wait for me.

177
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:49,428
Hmm.

178
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,919
The foul energy
will strip away his senses.

179
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:38,879
Right now, his eyes, ears,
nose and mouth

180
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,840
are being torn away in agony.

181
00:11:13,559 --> 00:11:14,360
Yuanchu!

182
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,120
I believe in him.

183
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,639
(Ziyan,)

184
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:28,799
(so this is the pain)

185
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:30,440
(you walked through.)

186
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,080
(In this way,)

187
00:11:32,399 --> 00:11:35,320
(I have shared all of your life.)

188
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,440
(I have no regrets in this life.)

189
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,240
Yuanchu!

190
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,960
Don't scare me!

191
00:12:16,399 --> 00:12:18,120
(Why does my heart ache)

192
00:12:19,159 --> 00:12:21,120
(watching him in pain?)

193
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:35,519
Yuanchu!

194
00:13:00,930 --> 00:13:01,937
Yuanchu!

195
00:13:06,679 --> 00:13:08,279
Heavenly Justice is complete.

196
00:13:08,956 --> 00:13:09,756
Yuanchu!

197
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,559
Senior.

198
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:35,720
I am back.

199
00:14:19,522 --> 00:14:23,450
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

200
00:14:23,722 --> 00:14:26,895
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

201
00:14:26,936 --> 00:14:30,568
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

202
00:14:30,593 --> 00:14:33,570
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

203
00:14:33,850 --> 00:14:40,800
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

204
00:14:41,266 --> 00:14:47,954
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

205
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:52,530
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

206
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:56,330
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

207
00:14:56,498 --> 00:15:02,727
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
